*RAPPORTER       *                                                              
******************                                                              
                                                                                
**RAPPORT 1 SEKTION                                                             
                                                                                
                                                                                
REPORT SEKTION                           +                                      
       PRINTER W22524D2                  +                                      
       LINESIZE 120                      +                                      
       PAGESIZE 41                       +                                      
       TITLESKIP 3                       +                                      
       NOADJUST                          +                                      
       NOHEADING                         +                                      
       NOSPREAD                          +                                      
       SUMCTL ALL                        +                                      
